3"}], "value": "Heterodimer of alpha and beta chains; disulfide-linked. Part of the B-cell antigen receptor complex where the alpha/beta chain heterodimer is non-covalently associated with an antigen-specific membrane-bound surface immunoglobulin of two heavy chains and two light chains (PubMed:35981043). Interacts with LYN (By similarity)"}], "commentType": "SUBUNIT"}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P40259", "intActId": "EBI-2873732"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P15056", "geneName": "BRAF", "intActId": "EBI-365980"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P40259", "intActId": "EBI-2873732"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "O43765", "geneName": "SGTA", "intActId": "EBI-347996"}, "numberOfExperiments": 6, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P40259", "intActId": "EBI-2873732"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "Q96EQ0", "geneName": "SGTB", "intActId": "EBI-744081"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P40259-1", "intActId": "EBI-15869023"}, "interactantTwo": {"uniProtKBAccession": "P40259-1", "geneName": "CD79B", "intActId": "EBI-15869023"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}]}, {"commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION", "note": {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"}], "value": "Following antigen binding, the BCR has been shown to translocate from detergent-soluble regions of the cell membrane to lipid rafts although signal transduction through the complex can also occur outside lipid rafts"}]}, "subcellularLocations": [{"location": {"value": "Cell membrane", "id": "SL-0039"}, "topology": {"value": "Single-pass type I membrane protein", "id": "SL-9905"}}]}, {"commentType": "ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS", "events": ["Alternative splicing"], "isoforms": [{"name": {"value": "Long"}, "isoformIds": ["P40259-1"], 